  <section class="cover">
    <h1>货币与金融知识高频考点总结（基础）</h1>
    <div class="cv-sub">经济金融基础知识讲义</div>
    <div class="cv-meta">
      <span>共 5 章</span><span>17 节</span><span>44 个知识点</span><span>原 PDF 34 页</span><span>文字可复制</span>
